# Minimal: dependencies for tracked dotfiles only (aerospace, tmux, karabiner, fish,
# neovide, vim, raycast, lazygit, yazi, btop, alacritty, ghostty, fastfetch, rust/cargo).
# Mole is optional (needs recent CLT): brew bundle install --file=Brewfile.mole
# Neovim is included because Neovide and the repo’s nvim/ config need it.
# TPM plugins use git, not Homebrew.
#
# Previous all-in-one machine snapshot: Brewfile.full

